        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Jong-suk, Han Hyo-joo, Yoo Jun-sang, Kim Eui-sung\n- Works: School 2013, I Can Hear Your Voice, Doctor Stranger, Pinocchio, W\n- Events: 2012 KBS Drama Awards\n- Roles: actor, model, host\n\nFacts:\n- Lee Jong-suk was born on 14 September 1989 and is a South Korean actor and model.\n- Lee Jong-suk's breakout role was in School 2013 in 2012.\n- The 2012 KBS Drama Awards were held on December 31, 2012, and Yoo Jun-sang and Lee Jong-suk hosted the event.\n- Lee Jong-suk is also known for his role in I Can Hear Your Voice in 2013.\n- Lee Jong-suk is also known for his roles in Doctor Stranger and Pinocchio in 2014.\n- W is a 2016 South Korean television series starring Lee Jong-suk and Han Hyo-joo.\n- Kim Eui-sung appears in the 2016 TV series W.\n- Lee Jong-suk is also known for his role in W in 2016.",
